  "item_short_desc": "<p>Engineered to work alongside you throughout the day, our Lightweight Canvas Work Jacket features a hardworking design that delivers unbeatable performance, reliability, and a broken-in fit from the start, allowing you to see any job through, both on and off the clock. From lumberyards to warehouses, this diligent work jacket earns its keep.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": null,
  "description": "<p>Engineered to work alongside you throughout the day, our Lightweight Canvas Work Jacket features a hardworking design that delivers unbeatable performance, reliability, and a broken-in fit from the start, allowing you to see any job through, both on and off the clock. From lumberyards to warehouses, this diligent work jacket earns its keep. Long-Lasting Work Ready Fabric: Like our collection of canvas bags and packs, the work jacket is crafted from a durable 12 oz canvas fabric. This superior material is naturally water-resistant, rugged, and is built for the long haul. These lightweight workwear shirt jackets are tough as nails and will stand the test of time. Storage Pockets: The working jacket features 1 chest pocket and 2 front slash pockets, providing additional storage for gear and everyday essentials. Utility at the Forefront: These canvas coats feature an antiqued brass zipper and adjustable wrist cuffs for finding the perfect fit. The drop tail back keeps you covered and protected as you work. Everyday Style: From the jobsite to a casual outing, the lightweight canvas shacket is great for work, travel, outdoor activities, and everyday wear during the spring, summer, and fall seasons.</p>",
